a: Terry Moran)  The campaigning by Vice President Dick Cheney on the terrorism issue featured; scenes shown from Camp Pendleton, California.  [CHENEY&nbsp- says we will vanquish the enemy; states terrorists are invited by weakness.]  [Bush-Cheney campaign press secretary Scott STANZEL&#134;- says Kerry has politicized the issue.]", "segment_duration": 290, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760747, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "26piuEtDGW", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-27", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760746, "segment_id": "wbErxRkyQz", "segment_broadcast_id": "26piuEtDGW", "segment_title": "Campaign 2004 / Democratic Convention / Speeches / Heinz Kerry Interview", "segment_description": "(Convention floor: Peter Jennings)  Tonight's speech at the Democratic National Convention by former President Ronald Reagan's son, Ron Reagan, on stem cell research, tomorrow's arrival of Kerry & tonight's speech by the candidate's wife Teresa Heinz Kerry previewed.  [In interview, HEINZ KERRY\u00a0- outlines what she will say in her speech about her husband & the country; comments on speaking unscripted from the heart, including why she told a reporter to shove it; notes what her husband will show at the convention.]", "segment_duration": 230, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63340.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760748, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcas